1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:02,795
(Penny:)than every
single day of my life?

2
00:00:02,795 --> 00:00:04,965
(Sheldon:)I won't be there.

3
00:00:04,964 --> 00:00:06,444
Look at that, it is a party.

4
00:00:06,447 --> 00:00:08,047
(Sheldon:)Oh.

5
00:00:09,368 --> 00:00:11,338
(Howard:)Sorry I have to work
all weekend.

6
00:00:11,337 --> 00:00:12,807
(Penny:)It's okay.

7
00:00:12,805 --> 00:00:15,005
(Howard:)Thanks again for breakfast.

8
00:00:15,007 --> 00:00:16,337
(Raj:)Well, I didn't get to
see you last night.

9
00:00:16,342 --> 00:00:18,712
(Raj:)It was the least I could do.

10
00:00:18,711 --> 00:00:21,411
(Bernadette:)You shouldn't have made
the alarm code his birthday.

11
00:00:24,183 --> 00:00:26,653
(Raj:)So, what should we do today?

12
00:00:26,652 --> 00:00:28,082
(Bernadette:)Oh, I appreciate it,

13
00:00:28,087 --> 00:00:29,757
(Bernadette:)but you don't have to
spend your day off with me.

14
00:00:29,755 --> 00:00:31,185
(Raj:)Well, I don't mind.

15
00:00:31,190 --> 00:00:33,490
(Raj:)Oh, you want go to the mall
and look at baby stuff?

16
00:00:33,492 --> 00:00:34,692
(Bernadette:)Not really.

17
00:00:34,693 --> 00:00:36,163
(Raj:)Oh, come on,
we could share a pretzel

18
00:00:36,161 --> 00:00:40,361
(Raj:)and get sideways glances
from racist old ladies.

19
00:00:40,366 --> 00:00:42,596
(Bernadette:)I get enough of that
when I take Howard

20
00:00:42,601 --> 00:00:44,471
(Bernadette:)to my grandmother's
for Christmas.

21
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:46,570
(Sheldon:)Oh,

22
00:00:46,572 --> 00:00:49,602
(Raj:)I know, why don't we get started
on clearing out the baby's room?

23
00:00:49,608 --> 00:00:51,008
(Bernadette:)Isn't it
a little early for that?

24
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:52,840
(Raj:)You have to
get to it eventually.

25
00:00:52,845 --> 00:00:55,575
(Bernadette:)Oh, there's so much junk
in there, it's embarrassing.

26
00:00:55,581 --> 00:00:57,781
(Raj:)How can you be
embarrassed around me?

27
00:00:57,783 --> 00:01:07,023
(Raj:)I'm gonna be in the room
with you when you give birth.

